WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.266
Interpretation begins with observation.

00:00:02.266 --> 00:00:08.652
Describe the pattern's location, shape, size, apparent contrast, boundary, and relationship to nearby features.

00:00:08.652 --> 00:00:15.038
Avoid naming a cause before the visible evidence and operating context have been considered.

00:00:15.038 --> 00:00:21.836
Compare the feature with an appropriate background or similar component under similar load and conditions.

00:00:21.836 --> 00:00:26.574
A hot spot is meaningful only relative to expected behavior.

00:00:26.574 --> 00:00:33.784
Uniformly warm equipment may be normal, while a small difference among matching components may deserve review.

00:00:33.784 --> 00:00:43.054
False impressions can come from reflections, sun loading, retained heat, airflow, wet surfaces, insulation differences, angle, distance, or automatic display scaling.

00:00:43.054 --> 00:00:50.676
Moving the viewpoint or changing the comparison can help reveal a reflection without proving the final cause.

00:00:50.676 --> 00:00:53.354
Preserve the scale and settings.

00:00:53.354 --> 00:00:57.680
Palette changes can make a small difference look dramatic.

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:06.126
Confirm whether the file contains radiometric data and whether measurement assumptions such as emissivity and reflected temperature are appropriate.

00:01:06.126 --> 00:01:08.804
Separate observation, judgment, and diagnosis.

00:01:08.804 --> 00:01:13.541
An observation may be an area of elevated apparent temperature.

00:01:13.541 --> 00:01:18.691
A judgment may be that it is anomalous compared with peers.

00:01:18.691 --> 00:01:23.841
A diagnosis of electrical failure or moisture intrusion requires domain evidence.

00:01:23.841 --> 00:01:26.931
Use confidence language and identify alternatives.

00:01:26.931 --> 00:01:33.317
Recommend authorized follow-up such as repeat collection, visible inspection, records review, or specialist testing.

00:01:33.317 --> 00:01:40.115
Thermal imagery is strongest when it narrows questions rather than pretending to answer every one.
